# Documentation only: the app does not load .env files automatically.
# Never put API keys here; enter them in Settings for encrypted storage.
# electron-vite supplies ELECTRON_RENDERER_URL during npm run dev.
# For isolated developer/test runs, set this in your terminal environment:
# LITTLELLM_TEST_USER_DATA=C:\path\to\temporary\littlellm-profile
# Do not set test variables for normal installed use.
